    {
      "id": "U7L-READ-1",
      "title": "The Game We Won",
      "text": "Last Saturday, our school held a local basketball game on the outdoor court. Before the game, our coach told us not to look down on the other team. We were not only tired but also nervous. In the first half, a tall player hit my arm by accident and injured my hand. The wound was small, so I put a bandage on it and kept playing. Our team raised the score little by little. When the last minute approached, I threw the ball hard and it went in. The judge blew the whistle, and everyone stood up to praise us. Our coach gave each of us a small reward after the game. That night I had to look up the word \"champion\" in my dictionary."
    }
  ],
